      "source_text": "import TGLExt.V351InverseLimitFaithful\nset_option pp.universes true\n#check TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseCutoffWeight_one_faithful\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseCutoffWeight_one_faithful\n#check TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_faithful\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_faithful\n",
      "stream_excerpt": "TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseCutoffWeight_one_faithful (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile)\n  (X : TGLV350.Regular.PositiveCoreInput P) :\n  Eq.{1} (TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseCutoffWeight P 1 X) 0 ↔ Eq.{1} X (TGLV350.Regular.PositiveCoreInput.zero P)\n'TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseCutoffWeight_one_faithful' depends on axioms: [propext,\n Classical.choice.{u},\n Quot.sound.{u}]\nTGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_faithful (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile) (X : TGLV350.Regular.PositiveCoreInput P) :\n  Eq.{1} (TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight P X) 0 ↔ Eq.{1} X (TGLV350.Regular.PositiveCoreInput.zero P)\n'TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_faithful' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice.{u}, Quot.sound.{u}]\n"
